   This uses `mkstemp` to create a secure temporary file in `/tmp`, which is safe (no path traversal or predictable filename issues).

2. **Editor Execution via Environment Variable**:  
   ```c
   const char *editor=getenv(""EDITOR"");
   if (editor==NULL) editor=getenv(""VISUAL"");
   if (editor==NULL) editor=""vi"";
