207990,pcre2,03654e751e7f0700693526b67dfcadda6b42c9d0,https://github.com/PCRE2Project/pcre2,https://github.com/PCRE2Project/pcre2/commit/03654e751e7f0700693526b67dfcadda6b42c9d0,Fixed an issue affecting recursions in JIT,1,1,"We are analyzing a function `get_recurse_data_length` from a PCRE2 (Perl Compatible Regular Expressions) compiler. The function is designed to calculate the length of some private data structure for a regular expression pattern.

