   - It checks that the device (GPU/CPU) of the node and its children are the same.
   - It checks that the convolution node has at least two inputs (so that we can identify the constant input), that it has only one non-control output (so that we don't break the graph by having multiple outputs), and that the convolution node is not in a set of nodes to preserve (to avoid breaking the graph structure).
